  "description_raw": "GunForce II(GeoStormin Japan) is ashootergame for thearcadethat was developed and published byIremin1994. It is the sequel to1991'sGunForce: Battle Fire Engulfed Terror Island. GunForce II's development team later worked onSNK'sMetal Slug, which contains similar gameplay, graphics, and sounds. Some of the music for GunForce II wasAir Duel.",
