  "id": 989,
  "game": "The Ninja Warriors (Arcade)",
  "target": "Triple-Screen Invaded City Boulevards & Capitol Stairs",
  "platform": "Arcade (Taito / Irem)",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/The_Ninja_Warriors/Gameplay",
  "canonical_title": "The Ninja Warriors/Gameplay",
  "description": "Triple-Screen Invaded City Boulevards & Capitol Stairs, The Ninja Warriors (Arcade) (Arcade (Taito / Irem)). Bangler has deployed all of the troops under his employ to stop Kunoichi and Ninja. These android ninjas are the protagonists for this game. The first player controls the red-suited Kunoichi (shown left) who is female in appearance.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Triple-Screen Invaded City Boulevards & Capitol Stairs' from The Ninja Warriors (Arcade) (Arcade (Taito / Irem)). World brief: Triple-Screen Invaded City Boulevards & Capitol Stairs, The Ninja Warriors (Arcade) (Arcade (Taito / Irem)). Bangler has deployed all of the troops under his employ to stop Kunoichi and Ninja. These android ninjas are the protagonists for this game. The first player controls the red-suited Kunoichi (shown left) who is female in appearance. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "These android ninjas are the protagonists for this game. The first player controls the red-suited Kunoichi (shown left) who is female in appearance. The second player controls the blue-suited Ninja (shown right). who is male in appearance. Each are armed with a pair of Kunai (Japanese daggers), and a limited supply of shurikens. Players start the game with 30 shuriken, with opportunities to obtain more, and which get replenished at the end of each stage. Each player also has an energy meter to indicate how much more damage they can sustain before dying. Kunoichi's energy meter and shuriken count is shown on the bottom left corner of the screen, while Ninja's information is displayed in the bottom right corner of the screen. Whether working together or alone, they are on a mission to destroy the evil dictator Bangler, who has not only seized power in the country of El Cabar, but is also a",
  "brief": "Triple-Screen Invaded City Boulevards & Capitol Stairs, The Ninja Warriors (Arcade) (Arcade (Taito / Irem)). Bangler has deployed all of the troops under his employ to stop Kunoichi and Ninja. These android ninjas are the protagonists for this game. The first player controls the red-suited Kunoichi (shown left) who is female in appearance.",
  "page_title": "The Ninja Warriors/Gameplay"
 },
